-- Update 1.6: Caverns combat zone, tougher bosses, crate key drops, keep inventory, unique skill replacement, fixes.
-- The update posts in Announcements, Server Updates and Changelog.
-- Generated by scripts/build-pages.mjs from scripts/guide-data.mjs. Only adds what is missing.

INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Update 1.6 is LIVE: Real Caverns Combat, Crate Keys & Keep Inventory', '**The Caverns are now a real fight!** Here''s what''s new:

- **The Caverns are a combat zone:** mobs and bosses can now hunt you down and hurt you there. The rest of the RPG world and the hub stay safe.
- **Tougher bosses:** Caverns bosses now **chase you** and have **more health and damage**.
- **Crate keys:** every kill in the Caverns has a **0.5%** chance to drop a **Legendary, Mythic or Cosmetic Key**. Bosses: **5%**!
- **Keep your items:** you no longer lose your inventory when you die, **except in the SMP world** (/smp).
- **Lost a banned unique skill?** You now get a new random unique skill instead.

[Read the full patch notes](/forums?c=server-updates) · [Caverns guide](/guide#caverns)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'announcements'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Update 1.6 is LIVE: Real Caverns Combat, Crate Keys & Keep Inventory');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Update 1.6: Real Caverns Combat, Crate Keys & Keep Inventory', '## ⚔ The Caverns Are a Real Fight
- The Caverns (**/warp caverns**) are now a **combat zone**: mobs and bosses can target you and hurt you there.
- The **hub** and the **rest of the RPG world** are still safe zones.

## ☠ Tougher Bosses
- Caverns bosses now **chase you** instead of standing still (they won''t leave their area).
- Caverns bosses have **more health** and **hit harder**. Bring your best gear and team up!
- Bosses still have up to **7 layers of armour** to break before they take damage.

## 🔑 Crate Keys from the Caverns
- Every mob you kill in the Caverns has a **0.5%** chance to give you a random **Legendary, Mythic or Cosmetic Key**.
- Caverns **bosses** have a **5%** chance!
- The key goes straight into your inventory, and chat tells everyone who found one.

## 🎒 Keep Your Items
- You **keep your inventory** when you die in every world: hub, RPG world, wild, survival, nether, end...
- **Except the SMP world (/smp):** die there and your items drop, like normal Minecraft.

## ✨ Unique Skills
- If your unique skill was one of the **banned** ones, you now get a **new random unique skill** in its place.
- Players who lost theirs before this update get one automatically the next time they log in.

## 🧭 Sidebar
- Outside the hub and the RPG world, your sidebar now reminds you: **Use /hub to return to spawn**.

## 🛠 Fixes
- Fixed a **server crash** caused by mobs fighting each other in the RPG world (mobs there no longer fight each other).
- Fixed Caverns mobs and bosses **not respawning** or showing up **twice**.
- Fixed Caverns mobs **ignoring players**.

[Caverns guide](/guide#caverns)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'server-updates'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Update 1.6: Real Caverns Combat, Crate Keys & Keep Inventory');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Changelog: Update 1.6 (Caverns Combat & Keep Inventory)', '## Added
- Crate key drops in the Caverns: 0.5% per kill (bosses 5%) for a random Legendary, Mythic or Cosmetic Key.
- Keep inventory on death in every world except the SMP world (/smp).
- Players whose unique skill was banned get a new random unique skill.
- Sidebar line "Use /hub to return to spawn" outside the hub and RPG world.

## Changed
- The Caverns are a combat zone: mobs and bosses can hurt players there. The hub and the rest of the RPG world stay safe.
- Caverns bosses chase players and have more health and damage.
- Mobs in the RPG world no longer fight each other.

## Fixed
- A server crash when one mob killed another in the RPG world.
- Caverns mobs and bosses not respawning or appearing twice.
- Caverns mobs ignoring players.', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 0, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'changelog'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Changelog: Update 1.6 (Caverns Combat & Keep Inventory)');

-- The Caverns Guide post gets the new combat + key info, only if nobody has edited it in /admin since Update 1.5.
UPDATE forum_posts SET body = '## The Caverns
A deep mine full of mobs, bosses and every kind of gathering node. No level needed, and everything you do down there pays cash.

- **/warp caverns**: Go to the Caverns
- **/caverns**: Your Caverns menu and trackers

- **Mobs** (Kill for cash): Every mob you kill in the Caverns pays **cash** and gives **Combat XP**. Stronger mobs pay more.
- **Bosses** (Up to $10,000): Bosses lurk in the deep. They have **up to 7 layers of armour** to break before they take damage, so bring your best gear and some friends. They pay the most.
- **Nodes** (Every type): Mining, Gemology, Farming and Foraging nodes are all down here. Gathering one pays **cash** plus profession XP.

- **Cash:** every kill and every node in the Caverns pays **$100 to $10,000**. Stronger mobs and higher-level nodes pay more.
- **There''s a per-minute limit** on Caverns cash, so mob farms can''t print money.
- **Trackers:** talk to the **Cavern Guide** NPC or type **/caverns** to see your kills, bosses slain, nodes gathered, cash earned, best payout and time spent.
- **No level requirement:** anyone can go. Your profession level still has to be at least a node''s level to gather it.
- **Boss spots:** each boss has its own spot with its **real name** floating above it. When it''s slain, a countdown shows when it''s back, and chat tells everyone when a boss is slain or returns.
- **Random Boss spots:** some spots hold a different boss each time. The floating text shows **☠ Random Boss ☠ Arrives in** with a timer. Every boss on that spot shows up once before any repeats, and never the same one twice in a row.
- **Mobs and bosses stay home:** bosses chase you, but only so far: they (and the mobs) are pulled back to their spot if they wander, so you can''t drag them out of the Caverns.
- **You can get hurt here:** the rest of the RPG world is safe, but the Caverns are a combat zone. Mobs and bosses will hunt you down.
- **Crate keys:** every kill in the Caverns has a **0.5%** chance to give you a **Legendary, Mythic or Cosmetic Key**. Bosses: **5%**!

**Doing no damage to a boss?** That''s not a bug. Caverns bosses have up to **7 layers of armour** that must be broken before your hits hurt them. This is **end-game content**: bring your best gear and team up.

Gathering works the same as everywhere else: hit a node **3 times** (the floating text shows your progress). It comes back after **1 minute**.

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#caverns)' WHERE title = 'The Caverns Guide' AND body = '## The Caverns
